@startuml 05-independent-tenant-relationships
title Domain Story 5 — Global Identity and Independent Tenant Relationships
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "Human Identity" as Identity
participant "Tenant & Access Governance" as Access
participant "Customer & Buyer Relationships" as BuyerRelationship
participant "Application API" as API

Identity -> Access : Authenticate once
Access -> Access : Resolve Workforce Membership for Tenant A
Identity -> BuyerRelationship : Resolve independent Buyer Relationship for Tenant B
API -> Access : Create one current Tenant context per request
API -> API : Apply server authorization and persistence isolation

note over Access,BuyerRelationship
One person can be workforce and Buyer in one Tenant.
Relationship types remain independent and never grant cross-Tenant data.
end note
@enduml
